### Angry billing problem
POST http://localhost:8080/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I was charged twice this month and nobody has answered my emails. Fix this today or I'm cancelling."
}

### Technical question, not urgent
POST http://localhost:8080/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi! When you get a chance, how do I export my data to CSV? No rush."
}

### Happy customer who wants to buy more
POST http://localhost:8080/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Love the product! Our team is growing and we'd like 20 more seats. Who can I talk to about pricing?"
}
